@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
title Proposed stable allocation (hand-worked design, not validator behavior)

start
:Preserve every explicit existing binding;
note right: Never moved.\nA request to move one\nbecomes a conflict/change proposal.
repeat :Next unbound role\n(canonical logical role-name order);
  if (Input kind / capability explicit?) then (no)
    :Suitability-unknown:\nstop allocation for this role;
  elseif (Unused endpoint with matching\ndirection and semantic type?) then (no)
    :Exhausted capacity:\nreport conflict;
  else (yes)
    :Capacity-compatible:\npick first by stable endpoint-ID order;
    :Proposed binding\n(role, endpoint, revisions,\nsuitability state);
  endif
repeat while (More unbound roles?) is (yes)
->no;
:Confirmed installation only with\ninstallation owner confirmation\n+ physical evidence;
stop
@enduml
